{"title":"数智赋能，聚势共赢！ 智造建筑领域案例实践与协同发展研讨会成功举办","date":"2025-07-01","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"article135\" data-role=\"outer\" label=\"edit by 135editor\">\r\n\t<section data-color=\"#1e9be8\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; height: 0px;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t<h1 class=\"rich_media_title\" id=\"activity-name\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; user-select: text; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: center; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n\t\t<strong>数智赋能，聚势共赢！</strong></h1>\r\n\t<h1 class=\"rich_media_title\" id=\"activity-name\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; user-select: text; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: center; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n\t\t<strong>智造建筑领域案例实践与协同发展研讨会成功举办</strong></h1>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t<section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-role=\"outer\" label=\"edit by 135editor\">\r\n\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"137605\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;background-color: #f4f8ff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;align-items: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"50%\" style=\"width: 50%;height: 3px;background: linear-gradient(to right,transparent,#28bfff);box-sizing:border-box;max-width:50% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"50%\" style=\"width: 50%;height: 3px;background: linear-gradient(to left,transparent,#28bfff);box-sizing:border-box;max-width:50% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding: 10px 12px 15px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; background-color: transparent;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em; margin-bottom: 10px; text-indent: 2.17647em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t6月26日，由广东省项目管理协会智造建筑委员会主办的&ldquo;智造建筑领域案例实践与协同发展研讨会&rdquo;在广州成功举行，吸引了众多专家、学者及企业代表参与，共同探索智能建筑领域数字化转型的创新发展之道。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-backh=\"312\" data-backw=\"554\" data-imgfileid=\"100014199\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202507/1.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box;\" type=\"block\" /></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 1.75em; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em; text-indent: 2.17647em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t广东省项目管理协会智能建筑委员会主任郑松出席会议并发表讲话。他指出，当前全球数字化浪潮正推动工程建设行业进行深层次变革，建筑智能化与AI技术创新应用已成为行业转型升级的关键突破口。他希望通过本次研讨会搭建交流平台，促进跨领域合作，助力行业同仁把握智能建筑发展新趋势，共同探索建筑数字化、智能化发展的创新路径。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-backh=\"312\" data-backw=\"554\" data-imgfileid=\"100014200\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202507/2.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box;\" type=\"block\" /></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 1.75em; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 15px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t广东省项目管理协会智能建筑委员会郑松主任</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 1.75em; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em; text-indent: 2.17647em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t广东省项目管理协会副秘书长戴晓伟在研讨会上指出，数字化与智能化技术正在重塑建筑行业生态。他强调，本次研讨会旨在打造一个集思想交流、经验共享、资源对接于一体的专业平台，通过促进企业间的深度合作与优势互补，为建筑智能化转型升级提供新动力，助力行业实现高质量发展新突破。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-role=\"outer\" label=\"edit by 135editor\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"137605\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding: 10px 12px 15px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" data-pm-slice=\"4 4 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-role&quot;:&quot;outer&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;edit by 135editor&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-tools&quot;:&quot;135编辑器&quot;,&quot;data-id&quot;:&quot;137605&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 10px auto;background-color: #f4f8ff;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;padding: 10px 12px 15px;background-color: #f4f8ff;box-sizing:border-box;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 15px; background-color: transparent;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-backh=\"298\" data-backw=\"530\" data-imgfileid=\"100014201\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202507/3.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box;\" type=\"block\" /></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 1.75em; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t广东省项目管理协会戴晓伟副秘书长</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 1.75em; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 12px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em; margin-bottom: 10px; text-indent: 2.17647em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t本次研讨会围绕&ldquo;数智赋能&middot;聚势共赢&rdquo;的前沿主题展开，聚焦智能建筑的关键技术、创新点及实际应用挑战。多位行业专家受邀进行了精彩的专题分享与深度探讨，为参会者带来了前沿的行业洞察与宝贵的实践经验。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section data-role=\"paragraph\">\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"126042\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;max-width: 100% !important;height: 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;align-items: flex-end;margin: 15px 0 10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0